  <main class="seo-section">
    <h1>Rooms &amp; Exits Chapter 3 Level 23 Walkthrough: Entertainment Room</h1>

    <p>Entertainment Room is the twenty-third room of Chapter 3, <i>Murder Dressed in White</i>, and it is the biggest single space in the chapter. A pool table and a foosball table sit on the rug in the middle, a row of arcade cabinets lines the left wall under a dartboard, a bar with a <b>CLUB BAR</b> neon runs along the back, and a sofa, a guitar and an amp fill the right side. Where Kitchen was a chain and Kids Bedroom was a shelf of small toys, this room is a set of stations: you can work the dartboard, the pool table, the bar tiles and the cabinets in almost any order, and only two of them end in a typed code.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with Webelinx Games, the developer of Rooms &amp; Exits: Escape Room Games.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Rebuilt frame by frame at one frame per second. <b>7561</b> and <b>56941</b> were each read twice from the green keypad display, at two separate seconds, and both passes agreed; 56941 also matches the top line of the HIGH SCORE table, which was read twice from its own crop. The four lines on the dartboard paper were read twice at two zoom levels. Anything that only ever read one way is listed under "What this page could not verify" instead of being printed as fact.</div>

    <LevelSelector chapter={3} current={23} variant="jump" label="Chapter 3 · Murder Dressed in White" />

    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Entertainment Room is room 23 of 24 in Chapter 3. Two typed codes: <b>7561</b> on the case by the foosball table, <b>56941</b> on the metal box, taken straight off the arcade HIGH SCORE table.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Read the room. Dartboard, pool table, bar tiles and arcade cabinets are all separate stations.</li>
        <li>Work the bar's six black-and-white tiles, the pool table and the dartboard paper: <b>1+6</b>, <b>4/6</b>, <b>2-5</b>, <b>3-1</b>.</li>
        <li>Open the case by the foosball table with <b>7561</b>.</li>
        <li>Pick up the <b>Token</b>, use the arcade cabinet, play the Breakout game out, then read the HIGH SCORE table: <b>YOU 56941</b>.</li>
        <li>Type <b>56941</b> into the metal box on the books. It opens on an arrow tile.</li>
        <li>Finish the record display, the pinned arrow board and the three-dial letter lock, take the <b>Key</b>, and open the door on the left wall.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

